WEBVTT

00:05:57.641 --> 00:06:00.669
a six-digit or probably
a seven-digit number.

00:06:00.693 --> 00:06:02.743
How many digits do you have, six or seven?

00:06:02.767 --> 00:06:04.021
Seven, and yours?

00:06:04.045 --> 00:06:05.765
Seven? Seven?

00:06:07.862 --> 00:06:08.976
And, uncertain.

00:06:09.626 --> 00:06:10.636
Seven.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.716
Is there any possible way
that I could know

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.416
what seven-digit numbers you have?

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:15.441
Say "No."

00:06:15.465 --> 00:06:16.780
(Laughter)

00:06:16.804 --> 00:06:18.901
Good, then I shall attempt
the impossible --

00:06:18.925 --> 00:06:20.976
or at least the improbable.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.524
What I'd like each of you
to do is to call out for me

00:06:23.548 --> 00:06:26.560
any six of your seven digits,
any six of them,

00:06:26.584 --> 00:06:28.707
in any order you'd like.

00:06:28.731 --> 00:06:30.063
(Laughter)